<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: aspirant -->
  <OE_Title_1_Aspirant.label>候选者</OE_Title_1_Aspirant.label>
  <!-- EN: The title of Aspirant marks the beginning of one's journey within the Obsidia Empire. Aspirants show promise in academic, technical, or administrative fields, and must prove their loyalty and skill through training and service. This initial stage determines their future standing, and many outsiders start as Aspirants when seeking to join the Obsidia Empire. -->
  <OE_Title_1_Aspirant.description>候选者头衔标志着一个人在黑曜石帝国旅程的开始。候选者在学术、技术或行政领域展现出潜力，并且必须通过培训和服务来证明他们的忠诚和技能。这个初始阶段决定了他们未来地位，许多外来者在寻求加入黑曜石帝国时都从候选者开始。</OE_Title_1_Aspirant.description>
  
  <!-- EN: exalted emperor -->
  <OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.label>尊贵皇帝</OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.label>
  <!-- EN: The Exalted Emperor is the supreme ruler of the Obsidia Empire, holding absolute authority over all its domains. Their wisdom, vision, and power are beyond question, guiding the Obsidia Empire's course through the ages. The Exalted Emperor is both a symbol of the Obsidia Empire's eternal legacy and the ultimate decision-maker in all matters, from military campaigns to diplomatic relations. Under their reign, the Obsidia Empire thrives, expanding its influence across the galaxy with unparalleled might. -->
  <OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.description>尊贵皇帝是黑曜石帝国的至高统治者，对所有领域拥有绝对权威。他们的智慧、远见和力量无可置疑，引领着黑曜石帝国穿越时代。尊贵皇帝既是黑曜石帝国永恒遗产的象征，也是所有事务的最终决策者，从军事行动到外交关系皆是如此。在他们的统治下，黑曜石帝国繁荣昌盛，以无与伦比的力量扩展其在银河系的影响力。</OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.description>
  <!-- EN: exalted empress -->
  <OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.labelFemale>尊贵女皇</OE_Title_10_ExaltedEmperor.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: arbiter -->
  <OE_Title_2_Arbiter.label>仲裁者</OE_Title_2_Arbiter.label>
  <!-- EN: Arbiters are entrusted with maintaining order and justice within the territories of the Obsidia Empire. They act as impartial judges in matters of dispute, ensuring that the laws of the Obsidia Empire are upheld with precision and fairness. Arbiters often oversee negotiations, settlements, and legal proceedings, handling both internal conflicts and relations with trusted external factions. Their decisions carry significant weight, making them key figures in the Obsidia Empire's judiciary system. -->
  <OE_Title_2_Arbiter.description>仲裁者被委托维护黑曜石帝国领土内的秩序和正义。他们在争议事务中担任公正的法官，确保黑曜石帝国法律得到精确和公平的执行。仲裁者经常监督谈判、和解和法律程序，处理内部冲突和与受信任的外部派系的关系。他们的决定具有重要意义，使他们成为黑曜石帝国司法系统中的关键人物。</OE_Title_2_Arbiter.description>
  
  <!-- EN: custodian -->
  <OE_Title_3_Custodian.label>保管者</OE_Title_3_Custodian.label>
  <!-- EN: The title of Custodian is given to those responsible for preserving the Obsidia Empire's most critical technologies, knowledge, and resources. Custodians guard vast libraries of data, secure rare materials, and oversee technological relics from the Obsidia Empire's ancient past. Beyond merely safeguarding, Custodians are also charged with advancing these resources, ensuring that the Obsidia Empire's legacy continues to evolve. Custodians often lead research initiatives or manage vital industrial complexes. -->
  <OE_Title_3_Custodian.description>保管者头衔授予那些负责保护黑曜石帝国最关键的技术、知识和资源的人。保管者守护着庞大的数据图书馆，保护稀有材料，并监督来自黑曜石帝国古代过去的技术遗物。除了单纯的保护，保管者还负责推进这些资源，确保黑曜石帝国的遗产继续发展。保管者经常领导研究项目或管理重要的工业综合体。</OE_Title_3_Custodian.description>
  <!-- EN: custodiana -->
  <OE_Title_3_Custodian.labelFemale>女保管者</OE_Title_3_Custodian.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: overseer -->
  <OE_Title_4_Overseer.label>监督者</OE_Title_4_Overseer.label>
  <!-- EN: An Overseer holds authority over a region or critical operation within the Obsidia Empire, such as a planetary colony or a large-scale research project. They are responsible for ensuring that productivity, efficiency, and discipline are maintained at the highest levels. Overseers report directly to the central governing body, acting as the eyes and ears of the Obsidia Empire in their assigned domains. Their leadership is essential to maintaining the Obsidia Empire's far-reaching expansion and infrastructure. -->
  <OE_Title_4_Overseer.description>监督者在黑曜石帝国内拥有对某个区域或关键行动的权威，如行星殖民地或大型研究项目。他们负责确保生产力、效率和纪律保持在最高水平。监督者直接向中央管理机构报告，在其指定领域充当黑曜石帝国的眼线。他们的领导对于维持黑曜石帝国广泛的扩张和基础设施至关重要。</OE_Title_4_Overseer.description>
  
  <!-- EN: high master -->
  <OE_Title_5_HighMaster.label>高级大师</OE_Title_5_HighMaster.label>
  <!-- EN: A High Master is a recognized expert in a specific discipline, whether it be in technology, administration, or philosophical teachings of the Obsidia Empire. High Masters are often called upon to mentor lower-ranked members, lead grand projects, or make key decisions that shape the future of their specialized fields. Their wisdom and expertise make them invaluable assets to the Obsidia Empire, and they hold considerable respect and authority in their areas of mastery. -->
  <OE_Title_5_HighMaster.description>高级大师是在特定学科中被认可的专家，无论是在技术、行政管理还是黑曜石帝国哲学教学方面。高级大师经常被要求指导低级成员，领导重大项目，或做出塑造其专业领域未来的关键决定。他们的智慧和专业知识使他们成为黑曜石帝国的宝贵资产，在他们的精通领域中享有相当的尊重和权威。</OE_Title_5_HighMaster.description>
  <!-- EN: high mistress -->
  <OE_Title_5_HighMaster.labelFemale>高级女大师</OE_Title_5_HighMaster.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: chief advisor -->
  <OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.label>首席顾问</OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.label>
  <!-- EN: The Chief Advisor serves as the closest counsel to the most powerful leaders of the Obsidia Empire. Tasked with providing strategic guidance and insight, the Chief Advisor plays a pivotal role in shaping policy, governance, and long-term planning. Their knowledge spans a wide range of fields, and they often speak with the voice of the Obsidia Empire's leadership in diplomatic missions or in the internal council. A Chief Advisor's influence can often decide the direction of entire sectors of the Obsidia Empire's operations. -->
  <OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.description>首席顾问是黑曜石帝国最强大领导者最亲近的顾问。负责提供战略指导和洞察力，首席顾问在制定政策、治理和长期规划中发挥关键作用。他们的知识涵盖广泛领域，经常在外交使命或内部议会中代表黑曜石帝国领导层发声。首席顾问的影响力往往能够决定黑曜石帝国整个业务部门的方向。</OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.description>
  <!-- EN: chief advisoress -->
  <OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.labelFemale>首席女顾问</OE_Title_6_ChiefAdvisor.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: grand executor -->
  <OE_Title_7_GrandExecutor.label>大执行官</OE_Title_7_GrandExecutor.label>
  <!-- EN: The Grand Executor is responsible for enforcing the will of the Obsidia Empire across its vast domains. As one of the highest authority figures, they are tasked with executing major policies, overseeing key operations, and ensuring that the Obsidia Empire's laws and commands are followed without fail. Grand Executors often lead the Obsidia Empire's most ambitious endeavors, whether they involve expansion, conquest, or reform. Their word is law, and their reach extends across all corners of the Obsidia Empire. -->
  <OE_Title_7_GrandExecutor.description>大执行官负责在整个广阔的黑曜石帝国领域内执行帝国意志。作为最高权威人物之一，他们负责执行重大政策，监督关键行动，并确保黑曜石帝国的法律和命令得到严格执行。大执行官经常领导黑曜石帝国最具雄心的事业，无论是扩张、征服还是改革。他们的话语就是法律，他们的影响力遍及黑曜石帝国的各个角落。</OE_Title_7_GrandExecutor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: supreme regent -->
  <OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.label>至高摄政王</OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.label>
  <!-- EN: The title of Supreme Regent is reserved for those who govern in the absence of the Obsidia Empire's highest rulers. They act with near-absolute authority, holding the power to make decisions on behalf of the ruling elite. Supreme Regents are trusted with maintaining stability and control across the Obsidia Empire during times of transition or crisis. Their leadership ensures that the Obsidia Empire continues to thrive, even when its primary rulers are otherwise occupied with external matters. -->
  <OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.description>至高摄政王头衔保留给那些在黑曜石帝国最高统治者缺席时代理政务的人。他们拥有近乎绝对的权威，有权代表统治精英做出决定。至高摄政王被信任在转型或危机时期维持整个黑曜石帝国的稳定和控制。他们的领导确保黑曜石帝国继续繁荣，即使其主要统治者忙于处理外部事务。</OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.description>
  <!-- EN: supreme regentess -->
  <OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.labelFemale>至高摄政女王</OE_Title_8_SupremeRegent.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: eternal dominator -->
  <OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.label>永恒统治者</OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.label>
  <!-- EN: The Eternal Dominator is a title of unmatched authority and strength within the Obsidia Empire. Those who hold this title have complete control over entire regions or sectors of the Obsidia Empire, wielding their power with an iron fist. They are both feared and revered, seen as embodiments of the Obsidia Empire's relentless drive for dominance and expansion. Their decisions shape the future of entire worlds, and their reign is marked by absolute command. -->
  <OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.description>永恒统治者是黑曜石帝国内无与伦比的权威和力量的头衔。拥有此头衔的人对整个黑曜石帝国的区域或部门拥有完全控制权，以铁腕行使权力。他们既令人敬畏又受人尊敬，被视为黑曜石帝国对统治和扩张不懈追求的化身。他们的决定塑造着整个世界的未来，他们的统治以绝对命令为标志。</OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.description>
  <!-- EN: eternal dominatrix -->
  <OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.labelFemale>永恒统治女王</OE_Title_9_EternalDominator.labelFemale>
  
</LanguageData>